    "sections": {
        "description": "High Performance is a clean, modern, and fully responsive free block-based WordPress theme built for sports clubs, teams, fitness centers, gyms, coaches, athletes, and performance-focused businesses. It is also flexible enough for corporate websites, startups, agencies, and general business sites. Designed for the WordPress Block Editor with Full Site Editing (FSE), High Performance makes it easy to create and customize your entire website visually without writing code. The theme is lightweight, fast-loading, SEO-friendly, and optimized for excellent performance across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. With 25 professionally designed block patterns, 18 customizable templates, and 15 reusable template parts, you can quickly build stunning pages including homepages, team sections, services, blogs, portfolios, contact pages, and more. High Performance includes clean typography, modern layouts, responsive design, and WooCommerce compatibility, allowing you to create an online store, sell products, or promote services with ease. Whether you are building a sports website, fitness studio, training academy, or professional business website, High Performance provides a solid foundation with a user-friendly design experience and powerful customization options."
    },
